@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### Shop configuration
GET {{baseUrl}}/simulator/config

### Validate registry mappings before persisting a proposed configuration
### In SQL mode an unknown shop/flavor returns 400; unavailable SQL returns 503.
POST {{baseUrl}}/simulator/config
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shops": [{
    "id": "it-roma-001",
    "name": "Gelateria Trastevere",
    "city": "Rome",
    "countryCode": "IT",
    "currency": "EUR",
    "timeZoneId": "Europe/Rome",
    "minItemPrice": 2,
    "maxItemPrice": 3,
    "flavors": ["Pistachio", "Stracciatella", "Dark Chocolate", "Lemon", "Fiordilatte", "Tiramisu"]
  }]
}

### Recorded-sale counters
GET {{baseUrl}}/simulator/status

### Latest generated sale, even if its database write failed
GET {{baseUrl}}/simulator/it-roma-001/sale
